      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Hello, for some reason, today the 4th badge was no longer enabled. I can now change my badges (see attached screenshot).\n\nYesterday, I restarted the game several times, but the 4th badge remained enabled in the list and I was stuck. I don't know what happened.\n\nHere the type of logs I got when trying to change my badges yesterday.\n\n\t\n\n```\n\n2026.06.05 01:01:06 Debug      -  Received Notification: <Notification from username:, sender user id: to usr_0a72e939-7dde-48f6-ae08-4235f8126c5a of type: badge, id: not_c50c6834-4acf-4a72-ad8d-5f77041b6211, created at: 06/04/2026 23:01:02 UTC, details: {{}}, type:badge, m seen:False, message: \"You've received a new badge: Pride Supporter 2026 - Awarded to those who donated to the VRChat 2026 Pride Month Charity Event\">\n\n2026.06.05 01:01:06 Debug      -  Received Notification: <Notification from username:, sender user id: to usr_0a72e939-7dde-48f6-ae08-4235f8126c5a of type: badge, id: not_566df463-09ae-445c-8641-875ad770d30f, created at: 06/04/2026 23:01:02 UTC, details: {{}}, type:badge, m seen:False, message: \"You've received a new badge: Gift (10 Months) - Awarded for gifting VRC+ (10 Months)\">\n\n...\n\n2026.06.05 01:02:26 Error      -  [API] [233, 400, Put, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/users/usr_0a72e939-7dde-48f6-ae08-4235f8126c5a/badges/bdg_66096bcd-1c5f-477b-803a-82a2af7ab675] Abandoning request, because - Too many showcased badges\n\n2026.06.05 01:02:31 Error      -  [API] [234, 400, Put, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/users/usr_0a72e939-7dde-48f6-ae08-4235f8126c5a/badges/bdg_66096bcd-1c5f-477b-803a-82a2af7ab675] Abandoning request, because - Too many showcased badges\n\n2026.06.05 01:02:42 Error      -  [API] [235, 400, Put, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/users/usr_0a72e939-7dde-48f6-ae08-4235f8126c5a/badges/bdg_66096bcd-1c5f-477b-803a-82a2af7ab675] Abandoning request, because - Too many showcased badges\n\n2026.06.05 01:02:48 Error      -